lantern music mirror letter window valley orbit letter cabin planet field thunder basket mirror bridge meadow orbit basket forest ladder silver silver golden steady golden basket winter canvas stone stone circle cabin garden corner orange copper helmet number marble number field purple anchor story music pocket simple marble maple engine music table garden ladder number forest signal island rocket violet winter letter cabin orbit falcon paper music pocket maple narrow planet falcon story ladder saddle pocket story letter letter planet cabin canvas purple shadow candle gentle island orange island falcon golden marble hollow copper number cotton market shadow hollow timber golden violet river orange falcon purple thunder orange simple music ladder valley window signal gentle saddle meadow window copper narrow stone field violet harbor field valley music candle signal island winter story number cabin hollow orange circle cabin table mirror lantern meadow narrow winter paper mirror thunder winter golden marble maple cabin purple signal signal table ribbon story rapid feather anchor basket letter rapid valley marble\\n\\nWrite a story of about 700 words that uses as many of the words above as you can.\"}]}],\"generationConfig\":{\"maxOutputTokens\":8192,\"thinkingConfig\":{\"thinkingLevel\":\"low\"}}}"
