        "response": {
          "bodySize": 4400,
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=UTF-8",
            "size": 4400,
            "text": "{\n  \"candidates\": [\n    {\n      \"content\": {\n        \"parts\": [\n          {\n            \"text\": \"In the quiet corner of the winter valley, a simple timber cabin stood beside a narrow, rapid river. Inside, a steady yellow candle burned on a square maple table, casting a gentle shadow across a canvas map. On the table lay a silver pocket mirror, a hollow copper lantern, and a letter written on cotton paper. \\n\\nThe letter contained a secret number and a story about a golden rocket hidden on a distant, purple island. Outside, the garden was frozen, and the meadow was a blanket of white. A falcon sat on the stone bridge, watching the harbor where an old iron anchor rested in the shallow water. \\n\\n\\\"We must find the market before the thunder starts,\\\" whispered Elara, adjusting her heavy leather helmet. She picked up a woven basket filled with orange fruit and tied it with a violet ribbon. Her companion, a builder who understood the complex orbit of every planet, checked the small steam engine he had mounted to a wooden saddle. \\n\\nThey left the cabin and walked through the forest of tall maple trees. The path was like a ladder climbing up the steep hill. Along the way, they found a smooth, round marble resting in a hollow stone, shining like a tiny circle of light. It was a signal. They were on the right track.\\n\\nSoon, they reached the bustling harbor market. Despite the cold winter wind, music drifted from a tavern window. Merchants sold everything from simple cotton cloth and silver feathers to heavy copper pots and golden lanterns. Elara traded her basket of orange fruit and a single falcon feather for a sturdy rope ladder and a brass signal mirror. \\n\\nBy the dock, a narrow boat waited. Its canvas sails were painted with the image of apurple rocket and a yellow star. They loaded their timber supplies, the heavy saddle, and the humming engine into the boat. As they pushed off from the stone pier, the sky darkened, and a low rumble of thunder echoed across the valley. The river carried them out to the open sea, toward the mysterious island.\\n\\nThe water was rapid and rough, tossing their small craft, but their progress was steady. Through the mist, the island finally appeared like a giant shadow rising from the ocean. They steered into a quiet cove, dropping their anchor near a natural stone bridge. \\n\\nClimbing ashore, they used the rope ladder to scale a cliff, entering a hidden garden filled with violet flowers that somehow bloomed in the winter air. In the center of a circular meadow stood the ancient rocket, its exterior made of polished copper and silver, gleaming under the pale light. It looked like a giant needle pointing toward the next planet.\\n\\nElara approached the rocket and found a square window near the base. Looking inside, she saw a simple table and a narrow seat, much like a saddle. Beside the door was a panel with a series of symbols. She pulled the cotton paper letter from her pocket and read the secret number aloud. \\n\\nHer companion turned the heavy marble dials until they matched the number. With a gentle click, the hollow door swung open. Inside, the air was warm, smelling faintly of maple and old paper. A single golden lantern hung from the ceiling, illuminating a glass mirror that reflected the starry sky above, charting a steady orbit through the cosmos.\\n\\nAs the storm broke outside, bringing heavy thunder and rain to the forest and valley below, they climbed into the cabin of the rocket. They secured the hatch, ignited the ancient engine, and watched through the window as the island, the harbor, and the silver river shrank away, leaving the quiet winter world behind as they rose into the velvet shadow of space.\",\n            \"thoughtSignature\": \"ElkKVwFpFH0T5VR5tcZfrjD7uDn1h/5AU0w0ilZUpE9uL8H+6DaIZGfubXJ1C2lwLambnRe58LvMkp4nfJV2mW1Qcd1ytvQvg1SCxRLQovjK0qEfut7ffFjqHQ==\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"model\"\n      },\n      \"finishReason\": \"STOP\",\n      \"index\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"usageMetadata\": {\n    \"promptTokenCount\": 20067,\n    \"candidatesTokenCount\": 740,\n    \"totalTokenCount\": 20807,\n    \"promptTokensDetails\": [\n      {\n        \"modality\": \"TEXT\",\n        \"tokenCount\": 20067\n      }\n    ],\n    \"candidatesTokensDetails\": [\n      {\n        \"modality\": \"TEXT\",\n        \"tokenCount\": 740\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"modelVersion\": \"gemini-4-argon\",\n  \"responseId\": \"7WjRaqiePJ_N-sAP3d_MgAU\"\n}\n"
